\subsection{Longer Recovery Duration}
\label{sec:longer-recovery}
\cref{tab:longer-recovery} reports the effect of extending the recovery stage.
While longer recovery yields slight improvements, the overall gains remain modest.
This suggests that extending the recovery budget alone does not substantially improve performance, while the primary performance gains arise from the proposed knowledge transfer.

